about UR/FORTH  yes ?
<GARY-S> Yes
<GARY-S> though LMI PC-Forth plus isn't exactly shabby
<[doug] D.GARRETT> Yes, Mike, I'd like to chat via voice sometime soon.  I'll 
hafta
<[doug] D.GARRETT> sell the idea to my partner in this endeavor.
