system. Also have experience with the 8096 metacompiler and have just ordere
d the 68xxx metacompiler.
<[doug] D.GARRETT> But we generaly agree that UR/FORTH is longer, lower, wider, 
and better.
<[MIKE] M.KELLY36> All very good products ( well supported too ).
<W.BADEN1> Last Friday I got the draft proposed ANS Standard.
