<W.BADEN1> responds the way you want.
<[MIKE] M.KELLY36> Agreed, but " ok " is a relic. A prompt that gives you BASE 
and DEPTH info is far better.
<GARY-S> Wil - You're a Mac user - or are you ?
<W.BADEN1> Yes/
<GARY-S> You do know Lowenstein is my Sept 19th guest ?
<W.BADEN1> Agreed, but no problem.
<[MIKE] M.KELLY36> Orioles outfielder?
